  - The `vscodeMatch`/`replaces` logic unchanged, but `entry.source` now `vscode`/`community`; keys IDs. Good.
  - The `catalogResults` logs IDs; fine.
  - The `message-ids.json` check ensures every ID in `en.ts` has an English mapping. The `en.ts` has 580 IDs; `message-ids.json` 580. Good.

